**`ost_check` was declined at the permission layer for a third consecutive pass.** Three passes have now written to this vault without confirming its invariants afterwards. The last confirmed reading is still the fifteenth pass's 0 violations over 241 nodes, and this pass added twenty-five nodes on top of the six from 2026-08-02. **A human should run `ost-agent check`.** This is not a server refusal and no agent can clear it.

